    representation
    transformation
    recurrence
    strength
    stability
    confidence
    supporting_evidence
    contradicting_evidence
    known_failure_modes

Example:

Pattern:
    revenue growth precedes hiring growth by ~2 months

Once represented explicitly, Pantheon can compare that pattern against other patterns.

That produces the critical second-order capability.

